  "statement": "Compute\n\n\\[\\frac{2^{3}-1}{2^{3}+1} \\cdot \\frac{3^{3}-1}{3^{3}+1} \\cdot \\frac{4^{3}-1}{4^{3}+1} \\cdot \\frac{5^{3}-1}{5^{3}+1} \\cdot \\frac{6^{3}-1}{6^{3}+1}\\]",
